Third-party domain-list integration
===================================

The optional community-list feature can download selected service lists at
runtime from:

    https://github.com/itdoginfo/allow-domains

The domain-list contents from that repository are not included in this source
tree or in the OpenWrt package. As of June 19, 2026, the upstream repository
does not contain a license file. Public availability on GitHub does not by
itself grant redistribution rights.

Downloaded content is controlled by its upstream authors and is not covered by
this project's MIT License. Users who enable the integration are responsible
for determining whether their use of the external lists is permitted.

Wise, Shopify, Notion, the Hetzner console, OpenAI, Anthropic, Perplexity, xAI,
LinkedIn, Spotify, TikTok and Hugging Face can download domain lists from:

    https://github.com/v2fly/domain-list-community

That repository is licensed under the MIT License, Copyright (c) 2018-2019
V2Ray. Runtime content remains subject to the upstream license:

    https://github.com/v2fly/domain-list-community/blob/master/LICENSE

The project-maintained lists under `luci-ikev2-domains/local-services/` are
part of this repository and are covered by the MIT License.

ISRG root certificates
======================

The package includes the public ISRG Root X1 and ISRG Root X2 trust anchors
published by Let's Encrypt:

    https://letsencrypt.org/certificates/

They are included as certificate data used to verify ACME downloads and are
not authored by this project.

Public Suffix List
==================

`luci-ikev2-domains/public-suffixes.txt` is derived from the ICANN section of
the Public Suffix List maintained by the Mozilla Foundation:

    https://publicsuffix.org/

It is used to refuse public suffixes in downloaded domain lists. The list is
subject to the Mozilla Public License, v. 2.0
(https://mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/), not to this project's MIT License.
Regenerate it with `scripts/update-public-suffixes.py`.

Onest typeface
==============

`luci-ikev2-manager/fonts/` carries the Latin and Cyrillic subsets of Onest,
Copyright 2021 The Onest Project Authors (https://github.com/googlefonts/onest),
licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1, which is copied beside them in
`OFL.txt`. The router pages and the services board use them.
